== Usage ==

Place this infobox at the start of a quest page. Navigation to the previous
and next quests follows the summary. All fields are optional, and blank
fields hide their rows.

<pre>
{{Quest
| type =
| startnpc =
| requirements =
| items =
| reward =
| previous =
| next =
}}
</pre>

FFXIV 1.0 quests grant no titles and cannot be repeated. The template therefore
omits Title Granted and Repeatable rows.
</noinclude>
